 "excerpt": "Celebrate with free empanadas, THC-infused mocktails, aura photography, shaved ice, and exclusive in-store cannabis specials. Learn more about the day’s event schedule here.",
 "html": "<h4>Join us for the <strong>Lady L Cannabis grand opening in Jersey City</strong> on <strong>Saturday, September 13</strong>!</h4>\n<p>Celebrate with free empanadas, THC-infused mocktails, aura photography, shaved ice, and exclusive in-store cannabis specials. <a href=\"https://ladyljerseycity.com/events/grand-opening/\">Learn more about the day’s event schedule here</a>.</p>\n<p>Of course, what would a grand opening be without some unforgettable deals inside the shop?</p>\n<h2>In-Store Specials</h2>\n<h4><strong>Doorbusters</strong></h4>\n<ul><li><p>First 100 customers get a<a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?order=-inserted_at&amp;brand=Kind+Tree\"> Kind Tree</a> Pre-roll</p>\n</li><li><p>First 40 customers get a<a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?order=-inserted_at&amp;brand=WYLD\"> WYLD</a> Edible</p>\n</li></ul>\n<h4><strong>Discounts on Shop Faves and New Drops</strong></h4>\n<ul><li><p>25% Off<a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?order=-inserted_at&amp;brand=Ozone\"> <strong>Ozone</strong></a> and<a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?order=-inserted_at&amp;brand=Simply+Herb\"> <strong>Simply Herb</strong></a></p>\n</li><li><p>30% Off<a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?order=-inserted_at&amp;brand=WYLD\"> <strong>WYLD</strong></a> and <strong>Old Pal</strong></p>\n</li><li><p>$10 Off New Drops: <strong>Bliss Co.</strong> and <strong>Wonderbrett</strong></p>\n</li><li><p><strong>and</strong><a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?on_sale=true&amp;order=-inserted_at\"><strong>more</strong></a><strong>!</strong></p>\n</li></ul>\n<h4><strong>BOGO Specials to Stock Up On</strong></h4>\n<ul><li><p>BOGO<a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?order=-inserted_at&amp;brand=Kind+Tree\"> <strong>Kind Tree</strong></a><strong> 50% Off Grape Gilati</strong> Eighth</p>\n</li><li><p>3<a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?order=-inserted_at&amp;brand=North+Lake+Supply\"> <strong>North Lake Supply</strong></a> pre-rolls for $20</p>\n</li><li><p>BOGO <strong>$1</strong><a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/?order=-inserted_at&amp;brand=Nimbus\"><strong>Nimbus Vapes</strong></a></p>\n</li></ul>\n<h4><strong>Spin The Wheel Deals</strong></h4>\n<p>Make a qualifying purchase of at least $30 for a chance at the following rewards:</p>\n<ul><li><p><strong>$1 Pre-roll / Pre-roll 5pk</strong></p>\n</li><li><p><strong>$5 Edible</strong></p>\n</li><li><p><strong>$10 Eighth or 1g Vape Cartridge</strong></p>\n</li><li><p><strong>Store Credit/Loyalty Points</strong></p>\n</li><li><p><a href=\"https://shop.ladyljerseycity.com/menu/products/accessories/lady-l-tote-blue-5603669/?order=-inserted_at\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Lady L Tote Bag</strong></a></p>\n</li><li><p><strong>Surprise Gifts</strong></p>\n</li></ul>",
